Guidelines for the Final Project Report  
a. Font: Times New Roman 
b. Font size: 12 
c. Line spacing: 1.5 line 
d. The page must be justified on both sides. 
e. Print the report on both front and back sides of each paper. (Let's conserve trees!) 
f. The main body of the report (NOT including the contents, index, preface, acknowledgement, certificate etc) must be 25 pages (or more). This isn't difficult if you worked on the project and as a team :-) 
g. Write the report yourself without depending on ChatGPT or Google or any such! Develop your written communication skills in technical English. 
Broad contents could be as follows: 
Abstract 
1. Introduction 
2. Literature Survey 
3. Proposed Work , Implementation, interfaces and communication (API etc) details 
4. Results & Discussion 
5. Conclusion 
6. References / Bibliography
